# FIXED-BLOCKS-AUDIT: the words of a refusal name what they refuse in full.
# A named Structure whose name is 300 bytes, given an argument at the root,
# is refused as more arguments than it has formals, with the whole name in
# the words, which were cut at 240 bytes before.
:
    size_t: value 1U
end: 

Other:
    size_t: p 2U
end: Other

: Other
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
